'' 'asc( W, n )' over a wide constant folds, reading past an embedded NUL as fbc does:
'' asc( wstr( !"A\000B" ), 3 ) is 66 (string/asc.bas).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/asc-wide-const-fold.bas -o tests/codegen/ascwideconstfold.exe
